&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect, synthesise and iterate data to create actionable insights. You work with a modern, AI-native toolstack - from LLM-powered environments (e.g. Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) a

